<title>USA: Thermo Ecotek Q1 Dec 28 shr rises.</title>
<headline>Thermo Ecotek Q1 Dec 28 shr rises.</headline>
<dateline>WALTHAM, Mass. 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thermo Ecotek Corporation Financial Highlights</p>
<p>					    Three Months Ended</p>
<p>			    Dec. 28, 1996    Dec. 30, 1995</p>
<p>Revenues		    $38,514,000	$34,296,000</p>
<p>Income Before Provision for Income Taxes</p>
<p>				  7,049,000	  4,845,000</p>
<p>Net Income		    4,300,000	  3,052,000</p>
<p>Earnings per Share		  .16		  .13</p>
<p>Weighted Average Shares  27,060,000	 23,291,000</p>
<p>NOTE: Earnings per share are restated to reflect a three-for-two stock split distributed in October 1996 in the form of a 50 percent stock dividend.</p>
<p>Full company name is Thermo Ecotek Corp</p>
</text>
